WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.992
(peppy music)

00:00:01.992 --> 00:00:05.477
- Right after school I
just like try to like run to the gym,

00:00:05.477 --> 00:00:07.893
so I can climb (laughs).

00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:10.393
(peppy music)

00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:13.745
It's a dangerous sport

00:00:13.745 --> 00:00:15.999
but the only thing that I'm afraid of

00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:18.462
is not being able to get to the top.

00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:20.962
(peppy music)

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.157
With climbing I don't think that

00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:33.183
it really matters with how big you are.

00:00:33.183 --> 00:00:35.613
If you're smaller, you can hold on longer

00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:37.827
and your hands might be smaller

00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:39.921
so it can fit more fingers on holds.

00:00:39.921 --> 00:00:42.421
(peppy music)

00:00:45.648 --> 00:00:48.186
I started climbing in Central Park

00:00:48.186 --> 00:00:50.348
when I was six years old.

00:00:50.348 --> 00:00:52.435
Now I don't think I could like live without it.

00:00:52.435 --> 00:00:54.935
(peppy music)

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.656
When you're close to the top

00:01:02.656 --> 00:01:04.654
of the climb you're trying to do

00:01:04.654 --> 00:01:07.786
you forearms usually feel
like they're gonna explode

00:01:07.786 --> 00:01:10.188
and they're gonna like burst open.

00:01:10.188 --> 00:01:12.132
You feel like you have to let go,

00:01:12.132 --> 00:01:16.143
but with climbing you just can't let go.

00:01:16.143 --> 00:01:18.098
I think that climbing is,

00:01:18.098 --> 00:01:22.015
it's obviously a sport, but
it's also like a dance.

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:25.904
You sort of have to be
able to like flow up the wall

00:01:25.904 --> 00:01:30.182
and come up with your own
technique to get to the top.

00:01:30.182 --> 00:01:32.709
I think people are
shocked if I do something

00:01:32.709 --> 00:01:34.855
that they can't do or something,

00:01:34.855 --> 00:01:38.363
because I'm still really
young, and I'm a girl.

00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:41.835
So, like, doing something that
even if a guy can't do

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:44.562
is pretty special (laughs).

00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:47.062
(peppy music)

